WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.480
The blue sky stretches endlessly

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.790
As I hum a tune to keep me strong

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:10.820
I wonder if you can hear the voice?

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.820
Oh, it's Kenzaki Makoto!

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:14.330
The melody continues forever

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:12.800
I love this song!

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:13.920
Me too!

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.500
It's great, huh?

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:18.080
I hope the seeds that my words carry into your hearts

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.440
Makopi...

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.840
We're here!

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:28.230
What a splendid day to get together!

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.160
The cherry blossoms are in full bloom,

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.360
there's not a cloud in the sky,

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.260
and it's sunny and warm!

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.590
Nothing beats it!

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:37.640
Nothing!

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:40.660
Mana, don't get so worked up. It's weird.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:41.790
But come on!

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:43.220
That very Makopi...

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:44.980
is right here!

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:48.520
Kenzaki doesn't look so thrilled herself, you know.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:55.430
I suppose Mana can't help but be overjoyed at Makoto becoming her friend.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:57.200
Totally!

00:00:57.630 --> 00:01:00.400
My heart's beating out of my chest!

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.620
Hey now, settle down.

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:11.180
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:13.650
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:16.520
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:18.560
Every day it sparkles

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:22.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:29.130
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:34.810
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:40.450
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:45.880
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:51.590
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:51.790 --> 00:02:00.470
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:02.130
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:04.540
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:07.370
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:10.180
What's more than just cute

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:14.050
is our promise between girls

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:20.090
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:25.990
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.060
Solitaire

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:32.060
Here?

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:35.700
This is where the man who gave you the Lovies lives?

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:37.140
That's right.

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:38.500
What's his name?

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:39.570
Name?

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:41.270
What was it?

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:42.670
Dunno.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:48.250
I'm sure that guy knows something.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.280
About the Trump Kingdom's queen!

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.660
Good afternoon!

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:01.460
Mister, it's Mana!

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:03.530
Mister!

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.360
Hello?

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:06.900
It's Mana!

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:11.240
It seems he's not present.

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:13.040
The door wasn't locked.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.440
Does he know how shops work?

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:19.840
Wow, look at all the Lovies!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.810
They're pretty!

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:28.590
Found something neat?

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:37.600
This is...

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:45.100
Kyupirappa!

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:45.100
Kyupirappa!

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.540
It's a giant egg!

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:55.510
If we made omelette rice with it, we could feed ten people!

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:56.680
Omelette rice?

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:59.450
Come on, it's not an egg!

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:02.390
Even ostrich eggs are only this big.

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:03.760
Dino...

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:08.030
It might be a dinosaur egg!

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:10.460
Or maybe an alien's!

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:11.860
No way.

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:14.230
Come on out, now.

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:15.630
Just kidding.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:41.130
A baby...

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:44.030
It seems it was a baby egg. {What egg isn't a baby egg?}

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:44.760
No way...

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:50.040
She's...

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.100
so cute!

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:53.870
Sure, she's cute,

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:56.270
but should that really be the first reaction you have?

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.840
She was born from an egg...

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:00.850
That's quite rare for a baby!

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:03.320
I think this is a step up from rare!

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.520
Aww, she's flying!

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:12.890
Very good!

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:14.590
Wait, that's a <i>good</i> thing?

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:18.560
Now, what about this shop's owner?

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:35.450
There, there.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:40.420
I believe that baby chicks think of the first person they see as their mother.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.050
So that's it!

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:45.120
Your mommy's name is Mana!

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:50.100
There's so much wrong with all this!

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:52.700
I don't even know what to say anymore! {I always thought I hated bokke/tsukkomi gags, but Rikka pulls her role off pretty well. Her lines are at least fun to TL.}

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:53.900
Davi!

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:58.100
It's time, Makoto.

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.710
What must you do, Davi?

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:05.080
I'm sorry to say it, but Makoto and I will have to excuse ourselves.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.380
We have work to do.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:09.010
Makopi, you're going already?

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:09.780
Yes.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:11.380
Goodbye.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.360
I didn't talk much with Makopi.

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:23.760
Not much you can do.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:24.830
She has a job.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:35.610
Did you sigh because you didn't find any clues about the queen?

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:36.540
Huh?

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:39.640
We can just go again tomorrow.

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:41.550
True.

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:44.220
Then why did you sigh?

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:51.620
I was thinking about how close those girls were.

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:55.930
Those three have been friends for years.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:58.700
But I'm different.

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:01.230
What?

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:05.600
You want to be their friend so much that you're overthinking it.

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:07.570
I'm not overthinking!

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:11.210
If you have something to say, just say it.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.110
You'll be friends in a heartbeat once you do.

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:16.080
Look, that's not it!

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:26.220
Solitaire

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:26.220
There, there.

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:28.760
Hm?

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:34.130
What's wrong?

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:35.800
He must've gotten scared.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:42.510
That's a...

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:44.110
Could it be?

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:46.110
A Cure Lovies!

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:48.810
Why does that baby have one?

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:52.720
She must have some connection to the Trump Kingdom!

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:56.120
What kinda connection's that?

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.290
Dunno.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:01.660
Well, let's give this a try!

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:02.430
Charles!

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:04.130
Charles!

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:18.840
A baby bottle!

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:25.180
She was simply thirsty.

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:26.520
She's really into it! {lit. "What a good drinking style." This sounds exceedingly dumb, and I assume you can tell she's enjoying it from her good drinking style.}

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.120
That's good.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.960
You've got a full tummy, huh?

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:36.230
After you feed milk to a baby,

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:37.730
you have to burp them.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:40.000
You're right, Rikka.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.330
Your mother is a pediatrician,

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:45.100
so you must know much about infant care.

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:48.210
Like this?

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:48.940
That's it.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:51.740
She did it!

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.850
An excellent burp indeed.

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:57.550
Good afternoon.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.980
We let ourselves in.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:08:59.980
Hi.

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:02.820
What brings you all here?

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:04.590
Well, <i>you're</i> one to ask!

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:06.390
What's with that egg?

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:07.560
I mean,

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:08.660
that baby!

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:11.830
This baby came out of the egg.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:15.030
Hm, how should I put this...

00:09:17.270 --> 00:09:19.300
don't you have to name her?

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:22.470
What should it be?

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:22.970
Huh?

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.810
She keeps saying "Aiai," {I'm sure she's just a fan of Super Monkey Ball.}

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:28.410
so perhaps it should be Ai! {Protip: Naming babies after their first word is not an optimal solution. See: Googoo}

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:29.950
Ai, huh?

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:30.920
Sounds great!

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:32.450
What a heartwarming name!

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:34.150
Can you two focus?

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.820
She seems overjoyed!

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:40.730
It's a wonderful name!

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.230
Well, if she likes it...

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:45.560
Her name is Ai! {Alt. "I dub thee Ai!"}

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:53.240
Noooooooooo!

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:57.440
Keep it down, Mammo...

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:01.410
My face, my beautiful face...

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:04.120
has a zit!

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:06.120
This is your fault!

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:09.750
You're always making a ruckus with your nighttime bowling,

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.390
and it keeps me up at night!

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:14.560
I need my beauty sleep!

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:22.330
You've got some nerve taking a nap after making sure nobody else can!

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:24.400
Bel's gone too.

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:26.140
Everyone's so selfish!

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:27.970
I'm so mad!

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:30.780
I've gotta make something go berserk!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.420
Hewwo, Makopi!

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:51.490
I'm widdle Ai!

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:52.890
Naiche to meetchoo!

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:56.740
So?

00:10:57.680 --> 00:10:58.390
Yeah...

00:10:59.020 --> 00:11:01.140
Aww, what a cutie!

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:03.740
Naiche to meetchoo too!

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:05.440
Is what Makoto's thinking.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.000
Wait, Davi!

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.980
Just speak your mind!

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:13.380
Ah, so Makopi fell for Ai's charm too!

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:14.970
You're so cute!

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:17.320
You're my sweetheart!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.390
Wanna hold her?

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:23.860
I'll pass.

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:25.700
Oh, come on. {やれやれだぜ}

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:28.470
Hello there, miss.

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:30.610
Nice to meet you.

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:32.440
I'm Joe Okada.

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:34.780
Oh, your name's Joe?

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:35.530
Huh?

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:37.070
That's <i>really</i> your name?

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:39.380
I have to ask you something.

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:42.580
It's about the the Trump Kingdom's queen.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:44.780
Do you know where she is?

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:46.920
Oh, a queen!

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:48.260
So you know?

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:52.590
Every girl in the world is a princess.

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:54.680
And you...

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:58.230
all of you are queens, in a way.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:02.630
My apologies,

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:06.000
but I have business to attend to. {Alt. "... children to molest"}

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:08.570
Look after Ai for me, okay?

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:09.900
Sure!

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:11.710
Wait!

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:15.880
He got away again.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:20.070
What a nice stroll!

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:22.380
Stuck with all the work, again...

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:24.660
That's nothing out of the ordinary.

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:25.860
Hm?

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:27.650
What is it now?

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:30.740
Hey!

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:32.180
Upsy-daisy!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.560
Too much upsy!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:38.020
Wait!

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:40.840
Here's your milky.

00:12:42.140 --> 00:12:43.920
Huh? That's not it?

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:47.240
If it's not food, try a diaper.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:51.770
Huh?

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:53.070
There's no mess. {I don't want to say "she's not wet."}

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.650
Wh-What do we do?

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:56.820
I know!

00:12:56.820 --> 00:12:58.320
I'll sing a lullaby!

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:06.500
Gooooo to sleeeeeeep!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:09.470
Gooooo to sleeeeeeep!

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:08.190
She's...

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:09.470
terrible!

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:12.240
Huh?

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:13.310
Why?

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:16.150
It's not a lullaby if it wakes the dead. {lit. "wakes sleeping children," but that's no fun.}

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:18.560
Though our diva doesn't seem to notice.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:22.280
Aw, shut up...

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.780
And I was havin' such a nice nap...

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:27.780
Way to ruin my lunch break.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.920
But I guess babies are born to cry.

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:37.530
And parks are for kids, anyway.

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:41.540
Aw, just sleep.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:43.170
Who's there?

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:46.600
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:57.340
Go berserk!

00:13:57.340 --> 00:14:00.330
Release the darkness in your heart!

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:09.730
Selfiiiiiiish!

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:11.700
A Selfish!

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:14.210
It's okay, Ai.

00:14:15.070 --> 00:14:18.200
I promise we'll protect you!

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:20.910
Now hide here.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:22.500
Everyone!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.460
Right!

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:25.980
Charles!

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:30.180
Precure Love Link!

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.100
L-O-V-E!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:32.880
L-O-V-E!

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:33.670
L-O-V-E!

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:34.740
L-O-V-E!

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:02.310
Brimming with love,

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.410
Cure Heart!

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:08.870
The light of wisdom,

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:11.010
Cure Diamond!

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:15.280
The warmth of the sun,

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:17.710
Cure Rosetta!

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:20.270
The blade of courage,

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:22.610
Cure Sword!

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:27.610
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:29.990
Dokidoki Precure!

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:33.780
Oh poor sheep who has lost his love,

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:35.950
I, Cure Heart,

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:39.320
will make your heart race once more!

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:44.090
Bedtiiiiiiime!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:46.750
It multiplied!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.130
Bedtiiiiime!

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:50.300
Something sprouted!

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:51.640
A fence?

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:55.440
Sheep number one,

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:57.490
sheep number two,

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:59.620
sheep number three,

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:01.810
sheep number four,

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.970
sheep number five...

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:05.300
Huh?

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:08.480
I'm getting tired...

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:09.820
This is no time for...

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.650
But it's so difficult to stay awake...

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:18.450
Now, finish them!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:21.030
Baaaahdtime!

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:24.250
Run wild, Selfish!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:27.400
Build Egogy for King Selfish!

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:29.070
Why you!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.510
Sheep number one,

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:33.240
sheep number two...

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:35.640
Not again...

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:37.440
I can't move...

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:40.480
Don't fall asleep, don't fall...

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:42.860
Good night...

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:55.270
This is the end for the Precures.

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:00.880
What a noisy brat.

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:03.000
Selfish, shut her up!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.400
Sheep number one,

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:07.130
